e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼虎丘枯桩和尚 其一","author":"释了惠","text":"佛心之子毒蛇心，欢喜无端变作嗔。\n五处住山开毒口，不知喷杀几多人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":5971,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪庭","author":"释了惠","text":"玉砌晓光寒，家风个样生。\n须知平白处，著脚是深坑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":5972,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄梅一会","author":"释了惠","text":"日暮下山投宿处，风前闻客诵经时。\n分明此处此时节，总在目前人不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":5973,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓北山小阁因事偶作","author":"释了惠","text":"老去将贫买得闲，十层梯下是人间。\n忽因送客闻新事，又嘱山童紧著关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":5974,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝阳穿破衲赞","author":"释了惠","text":"一衲横肩遮百丑，破处冷风吹不透。\n待伊穿线要重联，金乌已在西山后。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":5975,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"禅会图黄檗掌沙弥","author":"释了惠","text":"膝下黄金贵，掌中天地宽。\n风云欣际会，四海夜涛寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":5976,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢万年淮海寄拟为上堂","author":"释了惠","text":"不愁台岭路岧峣，生怕平田恶水浇。\n一杓又倾三百里，令人含恨不能消。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":5977,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢三郎赞 其一","author":"释了惠","text":"笠雨湿蓑烟，头陀行已圆。\n一桡横到底，不踏浙江船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":5978,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雁山出队上陈侍郎","author":"释了惠","text":"尊者从空掷钵来，神通用尽却成呆。\n看来不似维摩老，一默千门万户开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":5979,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"韩文公见大颠","author":"释了惠","text":"事繁求省要，省要事频繁。\n纵得三平老，文公只姓韩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":5980,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"布袋赞 其四","author":"释了惠","text":"转脑回头，百般卖弄。\n滞货只些儿，尽力拽不动。\n吽吽，我不信得恁么郑重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":5981,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"布袋赞 其三","author":"释了惠","text":"挑起悭囊，悭而不吝。\n回头等一个人，知是张何李郑。\n且等且等，等到弥勒下生时，或然等得也不定。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":5982,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]